# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository so that a fresh clone on Windows,
# Linux or macOS produces byte-identical task content. The gold patches in particular
# must not be rewritten on checkout: a patch generated from LF sources and checked out
# with CRLF is a classic source of "context not found" failures.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.patch -text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
